# Graphene, illustrative 2D in-plane stiffness matrix (N/m).
# Values are typical of literature reports for graphene's 2D elastic
# constants (e.g. Kudin, Scuseria & Yakobson, Phys. Rev. B 64, 235406,
# 2001, and later DFT studies); treat as a representative isotropic
# example for exercising the 2D-materials tools, not a precise citation.
358.0   60.0    0.0
 60.0  358.0    0.0
  0.0    0.0  149.0
